                        </item>
                        <item xml:id="a1_6406">
                           <locus target="#Throughout">-Throughout</locus>
                           <q xml:lang="ar">Notes, some marked: ṣaḥḥ, zayn yā, mīm ġayn, Maḥallī, mīm ḥā, Bidāyat al-muḥtāǧ, ḥā lām ǧīm, ǧīm, Barāwī, Ǧawǧarī, fā dal, Buġya, Mudābiġī, Imdād, Birmāwī, Ibn Qāsim, ǧīm ǧīm ǧīm, al-Bahǧā al-marḍiyya, Ḥāšiyat al-Šabramallisī ʻalā al-Nihāya, Šarqāwī, Šayḫ ʻAbd Allāh Bā Qušayrī, Bišbīšī, Muġnī, Nihāya, Fatḥ al-ǧawād, Qāmūs, ʻayn sīn, Ḥāšiyat šīn ʻalā mīm rā, Zayyādī, Rawḍ, Fatḥ al-muʻīn</q>
